    $ go test ./internal/services/mcpsvc/admin/ \
        -run TestResolveDuplicatesReportsThePersistedSuppressedHash -v
    === RUN   TestResolveDuplicatesReportsThePersistedSuppressedHash
        resolve_test.go:385: suppressed_hash = "9f58fcc457d8ab90" equals the
